#: scenario3:scenario3_EE8CF67C_0217_4510_AFFD_419978E61B7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3cdb854da1c1c494f271d106c0e97efc74810ae52d9643c58a2fcd84047eedf
#. default-sha256: be1049376da315b3f38d996f10358575ce423d7b412811079d0bdbdce6f12e22
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE8CF67C_0217_4510_AFFD_419978E61B7E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Our friendship will never change?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Hah! "
"What a fucking joke!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫변함없는 우정은 개뿔이……. ⟪k:9⟫핫, ⟪k:10⟫병신새낀가!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DE03DCD9_F0BD_444B_B962_A946DE8A7D12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e6c2821b7e81ddafe4c2a56e8d74c6f92107c400cb038feeeb6f9e7bdb0a14b
#. default-sha256: a780ba3aea3f984c710b831638fdacd75d4ac507eb45d9a436dd54b532efd38e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DE03DCD9_F0BD_444B_B962_A946DE8A7D12"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You picked the wrong girl to put your trust in.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And they call you “astute.” "
"Can you ⟪k:4⟫taste⟪k:5⟫ the fucking irony?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫넌 믿을 사람을 잘못 골랐어. ⟪k:2⟫그러고 관찰안이 있단 소릴 들으니, ⟪k:3⟫어이가 털리지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4E6F66EF_F7F0_4C53_B509_64822B3F3870
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73265cbbf514fcf8e9c723061ff2c8e6d355e5f06cc6fd1bf6027696053ee2fc
#. default-sha256: 5878054107e3227e15f718f9366f6551486cc4fc45d05c7e1e589e12a6a1e71d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4E6F66EF_F7F0_4C53_B509_64822B3F3870"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, that just makes things easier for me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫뭐―― 내 입장에서야 ⟪k:2⟫덕택 많이 보지만."

#: scenario3:scenario3_91908849_99EB_49C9_B70D_4697FFC5B83E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca9451f3a55fd925b308babb2cdc05d4e1d8773726465abe6bc8c2cbb75608ae
#. default-sha256: 496af055bb8286d2ac11ca123836a07d63c9c49dc393253b7afb176032e7434a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_91908849_99EB_49C9_B70D_4697FFC5B83E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But my ⟪k:1⟫god⟪k:2⟫, it’s suffocating playing the good girl.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That stupidly "
"cheerful little ray of sunshine Maria..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하 참, ⟪k:1⟫착한 년 노릇도 되게 뻐근하네.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫밝고 솔직하고 한결같은 마리아――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_25878519_CDCD_411E_A2D0_DAFE5078ED3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bf3089733f5c46abe2f1cb0874defc970d25ba4ec5227fac17ba57d12fe141f
