msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can’t stop!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫못 그만두겠지만서도!!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_60039B01_194E_401F_887A_8CA90615E312
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28eb0bcc8b2db5f9328001f54143b5b8dc14e73810c4164a339667fab9b288e0
#. default-sha256: 592eef7524a3bbde6c9a534c9cf0d843d14f240ddabe7e5c637f6bda1744c47f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_60039B01_194E_401F_887A_8CA90615E312"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫God, watching him lose his cool was ⟪k:1⟫incredible⟪k:2⟫!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My sides hurt just "
"thinking about it!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫진짜 재미지더라, ⟪k:1⟫허둥대는 꼬라지가 아주 그냥!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫지금 떠올려도 ⟪k:4⟫폭소하다 배 땡"
"겨 죽겠어!!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F97C4C36_6410_47A6_8CF2_596B69E2AF16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7294a1931f8324b01ff600f147f485f171a740a5e7c2f8a65c37cbff553f4730
#. default-sha256: 9208ad86e161b2d6f83f24085f7ba1bfa9dbfb0a4e31856258e908ce2534aadf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F97C4C36_6410_47A6_8CF2_596B69E2AF16"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫You’re "
"saying... ⟪k:16⟫You’re telling me ⟪k:17⟫she⟪k:18⟫ wrote this?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫이걸 ⟪k:16⟫"
"그 녀석이……, ⟪k:17⟫그 녀석이 썼다고!?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5BB701E4_DD4A_498E_8FC8_1AF132DF6C84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 088cf26215cf145040d87292279a8ecc48e688876c22cc5002180bdcfb582b36
#. default-sha256: 10f8fd46481b81c79bc08ba7ccfec395d9712e5259493a5b4d6e45c0ec37d431
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5BB701E4_DD4A_498E_8FC8_1AF132DF6C84"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Who else could have written it?⟪k:2⟫It’s in her handwriting..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫마님 말고 누가 있겠어, ⟪k:2⟫필체도 똑같아……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4EDA082F_906A_43F4_94E5_04D1190033D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fedaf17ccefb449cda54d571cc38c9d1fe409f09538471c211a67443f5e7922
#. default-sha256: c54e2b2039c8bb529766642efa92dd026509a7f5efa8f696b8193b8f17ced55b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4EDA082F_906A_43F4_94E5_04D1190033D6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why... ⟪k:2⟫Why?!⟪k:3⟫Why must she continue to betray me?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫왜……, ⟪k:2⟫대체 왜……! ⟪k:3⟫그 녀석은 왜 ⟪k:4⟫나를 배신하기만 해!!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A1AB147C_DC3A_44FA_B5BC_F5B6FE6F1D56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8036070da5d4ba948bdf122249f3c039407d0b1a09de6e070b5efc6efebb7fd
#. default-sha256: 76bbc2d13f553c873a1a334e031ad6aa4083f0b2a7a3bd27e33499a4bf96dd8d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A1AB147C_DC3A_44FA_B5BC_F5B6FE6F1D56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Has she not taken enough already?!⟪k:1⟫What else could she possibly want from me?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아직도 성이 덜 찼어――!? ⟪k:1⟫이제 뭘 더 제한해야 하는데!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_97EBAC32_A89C_4B29_B468_333EE3FE3BB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3987b2e2510ab457c522b16212ff3f40ba0408ec983b2daf4d2cedb356b5975b
#. default-sha256: dfd38d3292c88ca8683ebcd7afa06f2e579be0974778247bc215b2a7350a8956
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_97EBAC32_A89C_4B29_B468_333EE3FE3BB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I told her to stay away from my gatherings!⟪k:1⟫I had the rose garden torn down!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫회합에도 오지 말라고 했고! ⟪k:1⟫장미 정원도 없앴는데!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_94B079D8_7624_490E_8E12_1AA61EC4CD7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3520b723b1412f95e07c5293b7d591cbe998d073feebe436a1921afe95c975f
#. default-sha256: 66dcdee7ff1c6c94a5c40c44e47dcfa15d9fe54e026e7b3936117d1b211b0949
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_94B079D8_7624_490E_8E12_1AA61EC4CD7E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And yet still... ⟪k:1⟫she finds other men—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런데도 ⟪k:1⟫아직도 ⟪k:2⟫다른…… 놈하고……!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4C875E8F_EAB6_42A4_96A3_49E3618C9C8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6a6dec49d1e2013a84c306bf5d4cff77908650e850d07901a48a0daa8e685eb
#. default-sha256: 2215c609820a8eff8a8232f30270fbc3cac402d3358c4cfaac5659069b8d078e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4C875E8F_EAB6_42A4_96A3_49E3618C9C8C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I warned her!⟪k:1⟫Told her it wouldn’t happen again!⟪k:2⟫That if she betrayed me one more "
"time, I’d kill her!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫경고했을 텐데, ⟪k:1⟫배신하지 말라고…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫배신하면―― 죽일 거라고!!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_056B5CAF_3DF7_475B_9599_4F8E78478EFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bd3065bbedbec25b207027f5b0faa9825e6ee6092d3446255a4d5cc91c509d4
#. default-sha256: c0a154c9f236f9059b71af2ed71237083b9290f4869dd82266014097377c9481
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_056B5CAF_3DF7_475B_9599_4F8E78478EFE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……야코포……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6EC9BC0C_6BBB_4442_9FEB_25A76E9167B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0f1632138fc17e9d1bfeebc91e350a14b934429c628ad6ece918ecbd7251268
#. default-sha256: 1b0a6cdad756b05bbb1421664f41a0f692dea0f1f63c62db27be008d8c27f52e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6EC9BC0C_6BBB_4442_9FEB_25A76E9167B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Out of my way, Maria! I have to talk to her!⟪k:2⟫Ask her what this letter’s about! Who "
"this man is!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫비켜, ⟪k:2⟫마리아!! ⟪k:3⟫그 녀석과 얘길 해야겠어! ⟪k:4⟫이 편지가 뭔지―― 이 남자가 누군"
"지! ⟪k:5⟫철저히 따져야겠어……!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6B96DA7E_07C1_4CF3_A411_58AB52CF3395
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87a65788a0b162add0c39b9c4f85bed1f374bbdbcff4367463fc02384ae0923f
#. default-sha256: 3677e1f75e09f56ea105cede0c983c51e0f83c2d6e5222a13bf92591b81c0b03
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6B96DA7E_07C1_4CF3_A411_58AB52CF3395"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And depending on how she answers—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하는 대답에 따라선 ⟪k:1⟫그 녀석을―――!"

